{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o008b","title":"孙权围合肥张辽解释密教募八百士","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o008b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"孙权围合肥张辽解释密教募八百士","evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]},{"id":"zhangle-a-p002-judgment","label":"孙盛论","text":"孙盛赞魏武合肥密教以诸将刚柔参用，先击后守。","evidence":["zhangle-q-p002-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"围城","evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"决策募士","evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0237","role":"赞同","evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹操征张鲁时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o008b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o008b-q","source_order":[17,20,"O008b"],"order":3491}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0178","name":"张辽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0237","name":"李典","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o008b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-de092265329b0ffd8021","layer":"original","quote":"俄而权率十万众，围合肥，乃共发教。教曰：“若孙权至者，张、李将军出战；乐将军守；护军，勿得与战！”诸将皆疑，辽曰：“公远征在外，比救至，彼破我必矣。是以教指及其未合逆击之，折其盛势，以安众心，然后可守也。成败之机，在此一战，诸君何疑！”李典亦与辽同。于是辽夜募敢从之士，得八百人；椎牛飨将士〖8〗，明日大战。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":208,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-p002-judgment","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-031aef375812006f885b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“夫兵固诡道，奇正相资。若乃命将出征，推毂委权；或赖率然之形，或凭掎角之势；群帅不和，则弃师之道也。至于合肥之守，悬弱无援；专任勇者则好战生患，专任怯者则惧心难保。且彼众贪寡，必怀贪惰；以致命之兵，击贪惰之卒，其势必胜；胜而后守，守则必固。是以魏武推选方员，参以同异；为之密教，节宣其用；事至而应，若合符契。妙矣夫！”","attribution":"孙盛论","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ee57e972a1cb1aca16b1","start":0,"end":166,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
